Consistent spacing, quicker transitions and a camera-inspired step counter.
Improved completion layout, editor selection and draggable prepared folder.
Restored subtle shimmer and texture, with macOS 14-compatible shader builds.
Black-and-white inversion starts off for new preferences; existing choices remain saved.
Crop processing and export implementation are unchanged.
